  "body": [
    "With the support of Hermes Reply, IVECO Group has implemented an Industrial IoT platform to connect plants, optimise production, and enable data-driven decisions.",
    "As IoT adoption accelerates, businesses need scalable and secure connectivity solutions. 1NCE, a global leader in IoT connectivity, partnered with Storm Reply to develop a unified API infrastructure that ensures secure authentication, seamless integration, and real-time monitoring.",
    "This research delves into the innovation and trends of connected solutions for consumers, mobility, healthcare, and industrial uses.",
    "Discover how Sense Reply supported the management of Rome Fiumicino and Ciampino Airports through IoT, cloud, and artificial intelligence.",
    "Concept Reply partnered with OnLogic to equip Steve’s Auto World, a leading U.S. car wash operator, with a connected IoT solution that integrates sensor data, edge processing, AI-powered anomaly detection, and cloud-based automation to enable proactive maintenance and improve operational efficiency.",
    "Sense Reply supported a global energy operator, with an integrated IoT platform for energy asset management and access to the energy flexibility market.",
    "Discover also"
  ],
